{
  "description": "B 包，zh-CN，形参 `当`（结构关键词 WHEN）在声明与返回两处都隐藏反引号（ADR 0059 修订 5 E1 / E19 形状）：去掉任意一组反引号 当 出现在名字位置报 E901、编译失败，L10b 通过；verify --recompile 通过；show 打印不带反引号的显示文本（stderr 列出 hidden escape）；run --display 把名字改成 若 照常运行，改成会被静默改名的 版本 由派生排版的 L10b 拒绝（DISPLAY_REJECTED）；改成含间隔号的 若·前 使派生排版的 L10a（内容只能是标识符字符）在编译前拒绝（DISPLAY_REJECTED）。",
  "mode": "b",
  "target": "node",
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "aliasSet": null,
  "allowStructural": false,
  "claimedRefVersion": 1,
  "entries": [
    {
      "function": "床前",
      "default": true
    }
  ],
  "probes": [
    {
      "entry": "床前",
      "input": {
        "当": 7
      }
    }
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "run",
      "command": "run",
      "input": {
        "当": 7
      },
      "value": "7"
    },
    {
      "name": "verify",
      "command": "verify"
    },
    {
      "name": "verify-recompile",
      "command": "verify",
      "args": [
        "--recompile"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "show",
      "command": "show"
    },
    {
      "name": "show-canonical",
      "command": "show",
      "args": [
        "--canonical"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "run-display-unchanged",
      "command": "run",
      "display": "unchanged.txt",
      "input": {
        "当": 7
      },
      "value": "7",
      "matchesPackage": true
    },
    {
      "name": "run-display-renamed",
      "command": "run",
      "display": "renamed.txt",
      "input": {
        "若": 7
      },
      "value": "7",
      "matchesPackage": false
    },
    {
      "name": "run-display-silent-rename",
      "command": "run",
      "display": "silent-rename.txt",
      "input": {
        "版本": 7
      },
      "matchesPackage": false,
      "expect": {
        "code": "DISPLAY_REJECTED"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "run-display-escape-content-invalid",
      "command": "run",
      "display": "name-with-dot.txt",
      "input": {
        "若·前": 7
      },
      "matchesPackage": false,
      "expect": {
        "code": "DISPLAY_REJECTED",
        "stage": "derived"
      }
    }
  ]
}
